  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digitalization of the Agri-food Sector in Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based on the result, Dutch entrepreneurs should be able to decide their best chances in digital transformation in agri-food businesses. Furthermore, to the Dutch embassy, the report should provide advice on 1)	which technology or sector combinations to focus on; 2)	which type of Dutch government interventions might have the most economic impact on successful positioning of the identified most promising sub-segment of the Dutch smart agricultural sector.</narrative>
  </description>
